\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7qaYiT98knwQ7kNvwGW1ueT&_nc_oc=AdnrXqZy8DtpvNxZKB35mPLbmb_9Qu-poeiiBGq12pP66-t4xDUnULDC7_48gxoaly4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxbT-bjd3GTD83MZ9SxYmvKllJhEvA4nSptbOQGtZ0zAA&oe=69AEAD74"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fF6Pev5WKfIQ7kNvwHXXFyw&_nc_oc=Adk-VMxCCgj_4x0Nm99ifPACQKuXy1qX8Jxh_LkBlNsI01OdRSeiylVD7G87wuH99HE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzAWO__HBtCT_oWzqKRO2oRxgMvwNMsPaRqjs0Md9jGxg&oe=69AEAED6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VzJxD88NTAgQ7kNvwFuk1F3&_nc_oc=AdkIPTBJSeNW6bTNINMNF_Ey0mrWZzFCSURss8uniuxr6TlphGPcvSQX8ivaTL_xPmY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyFOPxEKr4xRl1zLQh7HsWZixV1liE2uzMq8REIsbsSuQ&oe=69AEC3F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771